{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 36,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 426.103,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.068,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My son,",
      "verse": "36:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 1.248,
      "end": 2.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "give ear to my words;",
      "verse": "36:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 3.146,
      "end": 9.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I swear unto you that inasmuch as ye shall keep the commandments of God ye shall prosper in the land.",
      "verse": "36:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 9.956,
      "end": 15.297,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would that ye should do as I have done, in remembering the captivity of our fathers;",
      "verse": "36:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.477,
      "end": 18.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they were in bondage, and none could deliver them",
      "verse": "36:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 18.768,
      "end": 24.016,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it was the God of Abraham, and the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob;",
      "verse": "36:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 24.196,
      "end": 27.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he surely did deliver them in their afflictions.",
      "verse": "36:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 28.127,
      "end": 30.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, O my son Helaman,",
      "verse": "36:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 30.443,
      "end": 32.811,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, thou art in thy youth,",
      "verse": "36:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 32.991,
      "end": 35.081,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and therefore, I beseech of thee",
      "verse": "36:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 35.261,
      "end": 38.094,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thou wilt hear my words and learn of me;",
      "verse": "36:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 38.274,
      "end": 41.943,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I do know that whosoever shall put their trust in God",
      "verse": "36:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 42.123,
      "end": 44.399,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be supported in their trials",
      "verse": "36:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 44.579,
      "end": 47.273,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their troubles, and their afflictions,",
      "verse": "36:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 47.453,
      "end": 49.821,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall be lifted up at the last day.",
      "verse": "36:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 50.501,
      "end": 53.891,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I would not that ye think that I know of myself\u2014",
      "verse": "36:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 54.071,
      "end": 56.718,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not of the temporal but of the spiritual,",
      "verse": "36:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 56.898,
      "end": 59.266,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not of the carnal mind but of God.",
      "verse": "36:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 59.946,
      "end": 61.896,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, behold, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "36:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 62.076,
      "end": 66.766,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if I had not been born of God I should not have known these things;",
      "verse": "36:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 66.946,
      "end": 70.94,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but God has, by the mouth of his holy angel, made these things known unto me,",
      "verse": "36:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 71.12,
      "end": 73.535,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not of any worthiness of myself;",
      "verse": "36:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 74.215,
      "end": 79.138,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I went about with the sons of Mosiah, seeking to destroy the church of God;",
      "verse": "36:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 79.318,
      "end": 82.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold, God sent his holy angel to stop us by the way.",
      "verse": "36:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 83.295,
      "end": 86.964,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, he spake unto us, as it were the voice of thunder,",
      "verse": "36:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 87.144,
      "end": 90.07,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the whole earth did tremble beneath our feet;",
      "verse": "36:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 90.25,
      "end": 92.34,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we all fell to the earth,",
      "verse": "36:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 92.52,
      "end": 94.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the fear of the Lord came upon us.",
      "verse": "36:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 95.476,
      "end": 97.705,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, the voice said unto me:",
      "verse": "36:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 97.885,
      "end": 98.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Arise.",
      "verse": "36:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 99.04,
      "end": 100.387,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I arose",
      "verse": "36:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 100.567,
      "end": 101.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and stood up,",
      "verse": "36:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 101.954,
      "end": 103.672,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and beheld the angel.",
      "verse": "36:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 104.352,
      "end": 105.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto me:",
      "verse": "36:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 105.972,
      "end": 108.48,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "If thou wilt of thyself be destroyed,",
      "verse": "36:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 108.66,
      "end": 111.028,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "seek no more to destroy the church of God.",
      "verse": "36:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 111.708,
      "end": 114.587,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I fell to the earth;",
      "verse": "36:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 114.767,
      "end": 118.204,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it was for the space of three days and three nights",
      "verse": "36:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 118.384,
      "end": 120.52,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I could not open my mouth,",
      "verse": "36:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 120.7,
      "end": 122.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither had I the use of my limbs.",
      "verse": "36:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 123.563,
      "end": 127.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the angel spake more things unto me, which were heard by my brethren,",
      "verse": "36:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 128.062,
      "end": 131.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I did not hear them; for when I heard the words\u2014",
      "verse": "36:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 131.4,
      "end": 133.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "If thou wilt be destroyed of thyself,",
      "verse": "36:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 133.948,
      "end": 136.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "seek no more to destroy the church of God\u2014",
      "verse": "36:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 136.543,
      "end": 139.794,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I was struck with such great fear and amazement",
      "verse": "36:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 139.974,
      "end": 142.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest perhaps I should be destroyed,",
      "verse": "36:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 142.476,
      "end": 145.495,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I fell to the earth and I did hear no more.",
      "verse": "36:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 146.175,
      "end": 148.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I was racked with eternal torment,",
      "verse": "36:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 148.677,
      "end": 152.996,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for my soul was harrowed up to the greatest degree and racked with all my sins.",
      "verse": "36:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 153.676,
      "end": 156.927,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I did remember all my sins and iniquities,",
      "verse": "36:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 157.107,
      "end": 160.172,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for which I was tormented with the pains of hell;",
      "verse": "36:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 160.352,
      "end": 163.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I saw that I had rebelled against my God,",
      "verse": "36:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 163.365,
      "end": 165.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that I had not kept his holy commandments.",
      "verse": "36:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 166.46,
      "end": 172.172,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and I had murdered many of his children, or rather led them away unto destruction;",
      "verse": "36:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 172.352,
      "end": 175.974,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and in fine so great had been my iniquities,",
      "verse": "36:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 176.154,
      "end": 179.637,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the very thought of coming into the presence of my God",
      "verse": "36:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 179.817,
      "end": 182.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did rack my soul with inexpressible horror.",
      "verse": "36:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 183.237,
      "end": 188.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Oh, thought I, that I could be banished and become extinct both soul and body,",
      "verse": "36:15",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 188.618,
      "end": 194.469,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might not be brought to stand in the presence of my God, to be judged of my deeds.",
      "verse": "36:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 195.149,
      "end": 199.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, for three days and for three nights was I racked,",
      "verse": "36:16",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 199.184,
      "end": 201.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even with the pains of a damned soul.",
      "verse": "36:16",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 202.093,
      "end": 206.18,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that as I was thus racked with torment,",
      "verse": "36:17",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 206.36,
      "end": 209.889,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "while I was harrowed up by the memory of my many sins,",
      "verse": "36:17",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 210.069,
      "end": 214.109,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, I remembered also to have heard my father prophesy unto the people",
      "verse": "36:17",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 214.289,
      "end": 217.911,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning the coming of one Jesus Christ, a Son of God,",
      "verse": "36:17",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 218.091,
      "end": 220.552,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to atone for the sins of the world.",
      "verse": "36:17",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 221.232,
      "end": 224.018,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, as my mind caught hold upon this thought,",
      "verse": "36:18",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 224.198,
      "end": 225.963,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I cried within my heart:",
      "verse": "36:18",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 226.143,
      "end": 228.976,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Jesus, thou Son of God, have mercy on me,",
      "verse": "36:18",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 229.156,
      "end": 231.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who am in the gall of bitterness,",
      "verse": "36:18",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 231.704,
      "end": 235.001,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and am encircled about by the everlasting chains of death.",
      "verse": "36:18",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 235.681,
      "end": 238.096,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, behold, when I thought this,",
      "verse": "36:19",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 238.276,
      "end": 240.644,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I could remember my pains no more;",
      "verse": "36:19",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 240.824,
      "end": 243.982,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I was harrowed up by the memory of my sins no more.",
      "verse": "36:19",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 244.662,
      "end": 248.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And oh, what joy, and what marvelous light I did behold;",
      "verse": "36:20",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 248.697,
      "end": 252.226,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, my soul was filled with joy as exceeding as was my pain!",
      "verse": "36:20",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 252.906,
      "end": 254.764,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I say unto you, my son,",
      "verse": "36:21",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 254.944,
      "end": 259.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there could be nothing so exquisite and so bitter as were my pains.",
      "verse": "36:21",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 259.954,
      "end": 262.462,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and again I say unto you, my son,",
      "verse": "36:21",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 262.642,
      "end": 264.407,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that on the other hand,",
      "verse": "36:21",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 264.587,
      "end": 268.116,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there can be nothing so exquisite and sweet as was my joy.",
      "verse": "36:21",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 268.796,
      "end": 273.997,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, methought I saw, even as our father Lehi saw, God sitting upon his throne,",
      "verse": "36:22",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 274.177,
      "end": 280.493,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "surrounded with numberless concourses of angels, in the attitude of singing and praising their God;",
      "verse": "36:22",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 280.673,
      "end": 283.041,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and my soul did long to be there.",
      "verse": "36:22",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 283.721,
      "end": 287.065,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, my limbs did receive their strength again,",
      "verse": "36:23",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 287.245,
      "end": 288.963,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I stood upon my feet,",
      "verse": "36:23",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 289.143,
      "end": 291.419,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did manifest unto the people",
      "verse": "36:23",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 291.599,
      "end": 293.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I had been born of God.",
      "verse": "36:23",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 294.183,
      "end": 299.059,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and from that time even until now, I have labored without ceasing,",
      "verse": "36:24",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 299.239,
      "end": 302.072,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might bring souls unto repentance;",
      "verse": "36:24",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 302.252,
      "end": 306.803,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might bring them to taste of the exceeding joy of which I did taste;",
      "verse": "36:24",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 306.983,
      "end": 309.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might also be born of God,",
      "verse": "36:24",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 309.81,
      "end": 311.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be filled with the Holy Ghost.",
      "verse": "36:24",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 312.626,
      "end": 314.623,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and now behold, O my son,",
      "verse": "36:25",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 314.803,
      "end": 319.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord doth give me exceedingly great joy in the fruit of my labors;",
      "verse": "36:25",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 319.941,
      "end": 323.47,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For because of the word which he has imparted unto me,",
      "verse": "36:26",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 323.65,
      "end": 326.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, many have been born of God,",
      "verse": "36:26",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 326.338,
      "end": 328.706,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have tasted as I have tasted,",
      "verse": "36:26",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 328.886,
      "end": 331.487,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have seen eye to eye as I have seen;",
      "verse": "36:26",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 331.667,
      "end": 336.079,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they do know of these things of which I have spoken, as I do know;",
      "verse": "36:26",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 336.259,
      "end": 338.627,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the knowledge which I have is of God.",
      "verse": "36:26",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 339.307,
      "end": 343.626,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I have been supported under trials and troubles of every kind,",
      "verse": "36:27",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 343.806,
      "end": 346.453,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and in all manner of afflictions;",
      "verse": "36:27",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 346.633,
      "end": 350.952,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, God has delivered me from prison, and from bonds, and from death;",
      "verse": "36:27",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 351.132,
      "end": 351.875,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea,",
      "verse": "36:27",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 352.055,
      "end": 354.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I do put my trust in him,",
      "verse": "36:27",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 354.278,
      "end": 356.182,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will still deliver me.",
      "verse": "36:27",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 356.862,
      "end": 361.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I know that he will raise me up at the last day, to dwell with him in glory;",
      "verse": "36:28",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 361.686,
      "end": 363.776,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and I will praise him forever,",
      "verse": "36:28",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 363.956,
      "end": 366.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he has brought our fathers out of Egypt,",
      "verse": "36:28",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 367.108,
      "end": 370.545,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he has swallowed up the Egyptians in the Red Sea;",
      "verse": "36:28",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 370.725,
      "end": 373.79,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he led them by his power into the promised land;",
      "verse": "36:28",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 373.97,
      "end": 378.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and he has delivered them out of bondage and captivity from time to time.",
      "verse": "36:28",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 379.48,
      "end": 384.124,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and he has also brought our fathers out of the land of Jerusalem;",
      "verse": "36:29",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 384.304,
      "end": 387.648,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he has also, by his everlasting power,",
      "verse": "36:29",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 387.828,
      "end": 393.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "delivered them out of bondage and captivity, from time to time even down to the present day;",
      "verse": "36:29",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 393.999,
      "end": 397.621,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I have always retained in remembrance their captivity;",
      "verse": "36:29",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 397.801,
      "end": 402.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and ye also ought to retain in remembrance, as I have done, their captivity.",
      "verse": "36:29",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 403.264,
      "end": 405.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, my son, this is not all;",
      "verse": "36:30",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 406.045,
      "end": 415.101,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for ye ought to know as I do know, that inasmuch as ye shall keep the commandments of God ye shall prosper in the land;",
      "verse": "36:30",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 415.281,
      "end": 420.761,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye ought to know also, that inasmuch as ye will not keep the commandments of God",
      "verse": "36:30",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 420.941,
      "end": 423.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall be cut off from his presence.",
      "verse": "36:30",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 423.443,
      "end": 425.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this is according to his word.",
      "verse": "36:30",
      "lineIndex": 126
    }
  ]
}